    "speciesNotes":  {
                         "ducks-geese-and-waterfowl--common-goldeneye":  "Rob and Janet helped me identify these Goldeneye\u0027s at Whiteswan Lake near Cranbrook. Fun times.",
                         "hummingbirds--ruby-throated-hummingbird":  "Hummingbirds finally found my feeders! I was so excited when I saw him. And it was right after I successfully plugged my tired. Good day.",
                         "cranes--sandhill-crane":  "SANDHILL CRANE!! Saw it in some random prairie in Montana while on road trip with Rory. We were freaking out. There were around 5 of them in the flock.",
                         "gulls-terns-and-skimmers--ring-billed-gull":  "Spotted these guys near Lake Michigan after Electric Forest. Pretty birds.",
                         "herons-egrets-and-bitterns--yellow-crowned-night-heron":  "Alise took these photos, we were walking the nature trails in Bayou Sauvage :)",
                         "ibises-and-spoonbills--roseate-spoonbill":  "Taken at the LSU lakes behind Blake Hall near Laville. These are my favorite birds I love them!",
                         "osprey--osprey":  "There are so many Osprey nests at Lake Martin. It\u0027s magnificent. Their calls are so interesting. They mate for life, and I saw so many cute couples. Lovely birds.",
                         "hawks-eagles-and-kites--cooper-s-hawk":  "Enchanted forest on LSU campus.",
                         "hawks-eagles-and-kites--red-shouldered-hawk":  "Indiana marsh on side of interstate on way to visit Kammy Wammy in Chicago.",
                         "woodpeckers--pileated-woodpecker":  "This guy popped out of a cypress tree at Lake Martin. He must have built his nest in the tree. Cool",
                         "falcons-and-caracaras--american-kestrel":  "Washington Prairie. These things are so cool they hover in place like a hummingbird and their tail split is awesome.",
                         "tyrant-flycatchers--great-crested-flycatcher":  "Laban, Nathan, and I went birding after watching Listers documentary in Burden in Baton Rouge and saw this awesome bird. We were so excited",
                         "crows-jays-and-magpies--clark-s-nutcracker":  "Mirror Lake in Banff. So many of these guys crackin nuts.",
                         "new-world-sparrows--spotted-towhee":  "Kept hearing this guy near our campsite in Washing in that weird prairie. The same night we got destroyed by those mosquitos.",
                         "new-world-warblers--yellow-rumped-warbler":  "Spotted this lil guy at Banff in Canada.",
                         "cardinals-and-allies--summer-tanager":  "Laban, Nathan, and I were birding in Burden. We think this is a summer tanager, but aren\u0027t positive."
                     },
